OL,3,GNEWSA'Vital' rescue equipment stolen
OL,4,Afrom fire station
OL,5,
OL,6,FVital rescue equipment worth #30,000
OL,7,Fhas been stolen from firefighters, a
OL,8,Flocal authority has said.
OL,10,FSurrey County Council said police were
OL,11,Fappealing for information following a
OL,12,Fbreak-in at Painshill Fire Station in
OL,13,FCobham between midnight and around 3:00
OL,14,FBST on Wednesday.
OL,16,FItems for saving people involved in
OL,17,Fserious traffic collisions and other
OL,18,Femergencies were taken, such as
OL,19,Fhydraulic cutting tools, it said.
